      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Bay Lake Tower is the Disney Vacation Club tower next to the Contemporary, linked by a skybridge. Studios sleep four; one-bedroom villas sleep five; two-bedroom villas sleep nine; Grand Villas sleep twelve. You walk or monorail to Magic Kingdom from the Contemporary, and you share that hotel's restaurants and pools.</p>
