  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Feature Pool</strong> at the Contemporary is the main pool, heated, with a 17-foot curving slide, marina views and a water-play area. Cabanas may be available to rent.</li>
      <li><strong>Bay Lake Pool</strong> is a quieter all-ages leisure pool, where official text says loud noise and splashing are gently discouraged.</li>
      <li>Some secondary write-ups mention a pool at the tower itself. The official Contemporary pool page we opened describes the Feature Pool and Bay Lake Pool and does not name a separate tower pool. <span class="verify">[verify whether Bay Lake Tower has its own pool]</span></li>
    </ul>
